			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct import paths for state types and IPC modules\n\nUpdate import statements across the registration modules in `Source/Binary/Register/` to resolve types via their new granular paths. Specifically, change `ApplicationState` to `ApplicationState::State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` to align with the recent atomic module refactoring. Additionally, update IPC function imports to reference the new sub-modules (`AdvancedFeatures`, `StatusReporter`, `WindAdvancedSync`) under `IPC` and adjust the IPC server reference to explicitly use the legacy `TauriIPCServer_Old` implementation during the transition.\n\nThese changes ensure the binary registration logic correctly resolves all dependencies, preventing compilation failures caused by outdated import paths following the module restructuring.",
